# Overrides that must win over the board definition's own defaults
# (gen_bmgr_codes/board_manager.defaults). The board manager reports that its
# file has higher priority than the project sdkconfig.defaults, so this is the
# slot for a value the product has to change on top of the board.

# The framework's default event-loop task ("sys_evt") dispatches the Wi-Fi and IP
# events. On this panel it overflowed its stock 2304-byte stack on the first
# configured boot — in the framework's own dispatch (MAC / netif / connect
# handlers), not in anything of ours: app_mqtt's handler now only copies the
# event into a queue, and the actual work runs on its own "mqtt_net" task. This
# leaves the shared task the headroom the framework's Wi-Fi dispatch needs.
CONFIG_ESP_SYSTEM_EVENT_TASK_STACK_SIZE=4096
